# AssemblyScript sources use AS-specific intrinsic types (u32, i32, store/load,
# etc.) and a dedicated compiler/tsconfig (assembly/tsconfig.json). They are
# type-checked separately via `npm run typecheck:wasm` in CI and must not be
# linted with the standard TypeScript/ESLint config.
